    "rating": 5,
    "reference": "ChIJ3QDlZdE3yUwROln-qyUN3g4",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "redscooter99h",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108618402662603048447/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIoiWFsP4tMOlvK28KvMpE51MQEsYssYS_FYyAiyjWcfE1HtA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "When I started training with Gabriel I was very out of shape and had mobility issues.  Over this past year I have seen such a change with not only my mobility but my flexibility, overall strength and stamina.  Gabriel is such a wealth of knowledge and possesses the perfect combination of patience yet knows when to push me to surpass my perceived limitations.  Working with him in one on one sessions has given me the confidence to participate in their group classes as well.  The whole team at Michael Gagne are great and they treat their clients like a family.  I look forward to continuing my fitness journey with Gabriel and the team @ Michael Gagne Kinesiology.",
        "time": 1747062840,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "nero flip",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102587100397236145418/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKtBQD45OX6LXAB4oYGLlTxniz8N2VSdxrXjbbo2UXyZNosRQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "In 2019, I suffered a terrible accident that left me with multiple injuries, including chronic nerve and muscle pain in my spine and shoulder. After three years of surgeries and hospital treatments, the doctors told me I would never get better—that I just had to accept it.\n\nRefusing to give up, I spent months researching ways to improve my condition. That’s when I discovered that working with a kinesiologist—a personal trainer specialized in mobility and rehabilitation—could be the key to recovery.\n\nIn July 2022, I found the best person for the job: Gabriel Elnoufi, B.Sc. Kinésiologue.\n\nPersonalized Approach: Gabriel didn’t just treat the symptoms. He looked deeper, identifying the root cause of my pain and designing a plan tailored specifically to my unique needs and circumstances.\n\nEffective Strategies: He brings a wide range of tools and techniques to the table, adapting them to what works best for me. Every session felt purposeful and aligned with my recovery goals.\n\nGabriel isn’t just a healthcare provider—he’s a true partner in my journey. Thanks to his expertise and support, I’ve regained control over my health, and more importantly, I’ve rediscovered hope.\n\nToday, I’m playing golf again—something I never thought possible. I will always be grateful for that.\n\nThank you, Gabriel Elnoufi.",
        "time": 1747931143,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Giuliano Verdone",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114877575369267003251/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIjMBkGBzVDexJuVMeTp2vico0sl4TC_MoSFK4Zm1tbt3GA7A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Over the summer I trained with coach Gabriel Elnoufi. I felt welcomed, motivated, and enjoyed every training session. In addition to being a great kinesiologist, Gabriel was super friendly and accommodating.\n\nIt was great having a workout plan that was made to reach my goals. I learnt a lot by receiving advice and having my mistakes pointed out to make sure I was doing my exercises properly. Thank you so much for everything!",
        "time": 1726355045,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "julie lemieux",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116282090622546202653/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIKszSqkI9WBQJFitXi5i-R0b6Yoaps-1BSQ1ujszLHRpBMiA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I've been training with coach Louis-Francois Milot for almost three years now. More than just a coach, Louis is a passionate, attentive, competent, understanding person who is 110% committed to his clients' progress. Always smiling, he will guide you to push your limits during your private sessions. His training plans are motivating and tailored to your needs. As a coach, Louis is always able to adapt to your personal goals through his responsiveness and constant support. A fantastic and professional coach whom I highly recommend! Thank you for everything.",
        "time": 1714103804,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Christine DN",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117689448436873217616/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUjik8B1Tfs9UEz3UMt-lrMyaJSczFgutoNoEt7RM1dg0amzc_NCQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "5 stars.\nI began my \"recovery\" journey with persistent shoulder pain (injury) and chronic lower back pain. After a little over six months of training, my pain has practically disappeared. I have more energy and feel much more comfortable in my body. Louis-François Milot is my private kinesiologist. The private training sessions are intimate, personalized, adaptive, and focused on our personal needs and goals. Louis is attentive and very professional; he helps me push myself and build my confidence.\n\nI also participate in group classes with Michaël. With his experience, Michaël has developed a unique concept. He offers a comprehensive and diverse range of training services.\n\nThe \"kinesiology zone\" is a truly friendly environment. Everyone can find their place there, regardless of their age, weight, health condition (beginners and advanced clients), or motivation.\n\nMichaël and his team are competent, dynamic, and committed professionals. I highly recommend them!",
        "time": 1719537674,
        "translated": true
      }
    ],
